      "q": "How much does Cgi Federal make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Cgi Federal obligated $1.2B in federal contracts in FY2026 to date. Cgi Federal won 280 awards in FY2026 to date, with an average award size of $4.4M, and obligations are up 3.6% year over year."
