    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Cgi Federal?",
      "a": "Department of State and General Services Administration are Cgi Federal's largest buyers, with $240M and $239M in obligations respectively. Cgi Federal also has substantial obligations with Department of Justice ($149M), Department of Veterans Affairs ($136M), Social Security Administration ($114M), Department of Health and Human Services ($77.2M), Department of Homeland Security ($73.2M), Department of Transportation ($60.1M), National Aeronautics and Space Administration ($27.7M), and Department of Defense ($27.3M)."
