    {
      "q": "What does Cgi Federal sell to the government?",
      "a": "Cgi Federal sells primarily IT and related services to the government. Cgi Federal's largest markets are Other Computer Related Services ($535M), Computer Systems Design Services ($269M), Computer Facilities Management Services ($202M), Computing Infrastructure Providers, Data Processing, Web Hosting, and Related Services ($58.1M), and Research and Development in the Physical, Engineering, and Life Sciences ($53.3M)."
